          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabo gwa mukaaga gwaija guri ogw'oruganda rwa Nafutaali, nibo Banafutaali nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwatano gwabo gukaba gutandikira Helefi, aha muti ogurikwetwa omwela oguri Zaananimu, guraba Adami-nekebu, na Yabuneeli, guhika Lakumu, gugarukira Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba gukiikama, guhika Azinoosi-tabora; okuruga aho guraba Hukooki, guhika Zebuluuni aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, kandi guhika Asheri aha rubaju rw'oburengyerwa-izooba, kandi aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba guhika Yuda ahari Yorudani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi endembo zaabo ez'engo ezigumire nizo ezi; Zidimu, Zeera, Hamasi, Rakasi, Kinereesi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adama, Raama, Hazori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedeshi, Edurei, Enihazori, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Irooni, Migudaleeli, Horemu, Besanaasi, na Besi-shemeshi; endembo ikumi na mwenda n'ebirorero byazo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo nibwo buhunguzi bw'oruganda rwa Nafutaali, n'endembo zaabo n'ebirorero byazo, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
