              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugabo gwa mushanju gwaija guri ogw'oruganda rwa Daani, nk'oku emiryango yaabo yaabaire eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.19.40",
