        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'ekyanga ky'aba Daani kubabeera kikye, bakainamuka, baateera Leshemu, baagikwata, baagihwerekyereza na rurara, baagikubuura, baagituuramu. Leshemu egyo baagyeta Daani, nibagyeterera ishenkurubo Daani. ",
          "type": "text",
