        {
          "text": "Ku baaherize kubaganisa ensi omu bicweka byayo, nk'emyatano y'obuhunguzi bwabo oku eri, Abaisraeli baha Yoshua mwene Nuuni obuhunguzi ahagati yaabo; ",
